  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Dilshad vs Adjudicating Officer / Additional ... on 31 January, 2020 Author: Kaushal Jayendra Thaker Bench: Kaushal Jayendra Thaker High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Court No. - 33 Case :- First Appeal From Order",
    "facts": "Brief facts giving rise to the present appeal is that appellant is a seller fruits at the road side of Sarsaul, Aligarh. On 15.10.2016 He was falsely implicated by the respondent no.2 on the allegations of ripening banana by applying chemical. Sample of the fruit was sent to Food Analytic, Lucknow and after getting report therefrom, a Case No. 38 of 2017 was registered before respondent no.1. Appellant filed his objection to the notice issued to him but, according to the appellant, without considering his reply an order was passed by the respondent no.1 on 26.8.2019 imposing a penalty of Rs.5,00,000/- against the appellant under Section 57(1)(ii) of Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006.",
